<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks drop to 122,183.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks drop to 122,183.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of July 22 totaled 122,183 bales, down from 122,424 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, no bales awaiting review, 241 cancellations,  and 7,441 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
